  "usage": "Normalize screen text first: NFKC, lowercase, curly quotes to straight, strip zero-width chars (U+200B-U+200D, U+2060, U+FEFF), collapse whitespace. Score: each distinct keyword 1, each distinct payment_red_flag 2, any strong_phrase 5, toll-free phone on a browser page 2, full-screen browser window 2. Score >= 3 -> Jev scam check. Strong phrase and Jev unavailable and host not in trusted_info_domains -> show the warning anyway. trusted_info_domains subtract 3. Regexes: compile with new RegExp(s, 'g'); mbi with 'gi'. card also needs a Luhn check and routing an ABA checksum before counting as a hit. Keywords and phrases match on word boundaries, never as raw substrings (irs must not hit first). Domain lists match by suffix (host === d || host.endsWith('.' + d)).",
